{"seq":89,"slug":"rate-limiting-backpressure","title":"限流与背压设计","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure","rating":{"composite":3.82,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 限流与背压设计\n\n任何一个对外提供能力的系统，迟早会遇到「请求来得比我处理得快」这一刻。可能是促销活动的流量洪峰，可能是上游服务异常后的重试风暴，也可能是某个客户端写了死循环。当到达速率持续超过服务能力，队列堆积、延迟飙升、内存耗尽、线程池打满，最终整个系统雪崩——而且往往是从一个不起眼的下游开始，沿着调用链一路传染。限流与背压，正是用来在过载到来之前主动控制流量、在过载发生时优雅降级的两套互补武器。\n\n这个 hub 把这套知识拆成四条递进的主线。第一条是「限流基础与算法」：先讲清楚为什么必须限流、过载会以怎样的非线性方式摧毁稳定性，再把令牌桶、漏桶、固定窗口、滑动窗口这几个经典算法逐一拆开，理解它们各自允许怎样的突发、付出怎样的代价。这是后面所有内容的词汇表。\n\n第二条是「背压与流量控制」。限流是「我主动拒绝超额请求」，背压则是「我向上游传递『我处理不过来了，你慢点发』的信号」。这一章讲背压如何沿调用链反向传播、为什么有界队列是背压的物理载体、以及响应式流（Reactive Streams）如何用拉模型（pull）把消费者的处理能力变成显式的需求信号。\n\n第三条是「分布式限流」。单机限流的算法搬到多副本、多节点时会立刻碰壁：计数放哪、时钟是否一致、热点 key 怎么办。这一章讲基于 Redis 的集中式限流与 GCRA、API 网关如何做配额与多租户隔离、以及当限流也救不了时如何做负载卸载（load shedding）和按优先级丢弃。\n\n第四条是「工程实践」，把前三章的原理落到可上线的代码与运维上：客户端如何重试才不会制造重试风暴（退避与抖动）、如何用熔断与隔板把故障隔离在局部、以及如何给限流系统装上可观测性并持续调参。\n\n四条主线层层递进：算法是地基，背压是把限流从「点」扩展成「链」，分布式把单机方案推向真实拓扑，工程实践则让一切真正可运维。读完这个 hub，你应当能为一个具体系统选对算法、画出背压传播路径、设计分布式配额，并把熔断、重试、可观测串成一套自洽的稳定性方案。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"限流基础与算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-rate-limiting","title":"为何限流：过载与稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/foundations/why-rate-limiting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"token-leaky-bucket","title":"令牌桶与漏桶算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/foundations/token-leaky-bucket"},{"seq":3,"slug":"window-counters","title":"固定与滑动窗口计数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/foundations/window-counters"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"backpressure","title":"背压与流量控制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/backpressure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"backpressure-principles","title":"背压原理与传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/backpressure/backpressure-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bounded-queues-buffers","title":"有界队列与缓冲管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/backpressure/bounded-queues-buffers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reactive-flow-control","title":"响应式流与拉模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/backpressure/reactive-flow-control"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"distributed","title":"分布式限流","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/distributed","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"distributed-rate-limiting","title":"分布式限流与一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/distributed/distributed-rate-limiting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"api-gateway-throttling","title":"网关限流与配额","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/distributed/api-gateway-throttling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"load-shedding-priority","title":"负载卸载与优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/distributed/load-shedding-priority"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"client-retry-jitter","title":"客户端重试、退避与抖动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/practice/client-retry-jitter"},{"seq":2,"slug":"circuit-breaker-bulkhead","title":"熔断、隔板与超时","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/practice/circuit-breaker-bulkhead"},{"seq":3,"slug":"observability-tuning","title":"限流可观测与调参","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/practice/observability-tuning"}]}]}